y, wiping free disk space to hide traces of files deleted by other applications, and vacuuming Firefox to make it faster. Better than free, BleachBit is open source.","moniker":"bleachbit","name":"BleachBit","packageUrl":"https://www.bleachbit.org/","publisher":"BleachBit","publisherUrl":"https://www.bleachbit.org/","releaseNotesUrl":"https://www.bleachbit.org/news/bleachbit-502","tags":["cache","clean","clear","cookies","delete","disk-space","junk","logs","remove","shred","temp","temporary-files","wipe"]},"zh-CN":{"description":"清理系统并释放磁盘空间","license":"GPL-3.0","licenseUrl":"https://www.gnu.org/licenses/gpl-3.0.html","locale":"zh-CN","longDescription":"当你的电脑越来越满时，BleachBit 可以快速释放磁盘空间。当你的信息只与你有关时，BleachBit 可以保护你的隐私。使用 BleachBit，你可以释放缓存、删除 cookies、清除上网历史、粉碎临时文件、删除日志，并丢弃你不知道的垃圾文件。它专为 Linux 和 Windows 系统设计，可以清除数以千计的应用程序，包括 Firefox、Adobe Flash、Google Chrome、Opera 等。除了删除文件外，BleachBit 还具有一些高级功能，例如粉碎文件以防止恢复、清除可用磁盘空间以隐藏被其它应用程序删除的文件的痕迹，以及清理火狐浏览器以使其运行更快。比免费更好的是，BleachBit 是开源的。","name":"BleachBit","packageUrl":"https://www.bleachbit.org/","publisher":"BleachBit","publisherUrl":"https://www.bleachbit.org/","releaseNotesUrl":"https://www.bleachbit.org/news/bleachbit-502","tags":["cookies","临时文件","删除","垃圾","擦除","日志","清理","清除","磁盘空间","移除","粉碎","缓存"]}},"publisherUrl":"https://www.bleachbit.org/","releaseNotesUrl":"https://www.bleachbit.org/news/bleachbit-502","schemaVersion":1,"source":"winget","upstream":{"commit":"97d6aa2689f0a05f7847653a62b8624720d15b5d","manifestVersion":"1.12.0","manifests":[{"path":"manifests/b/BleachBit/BleachBit/5.0.2.3065/BleachBit.BleachBit.yaml","sha256":"a764f0bb0173fa33be0ea5c97fd60b4a1fcec9341779832b61bc866572e7c108"},{"path":"manifests/b/BleachBit/BleachBit/5.0.2.3065/BleachBit.BleachBit.installer.yaml","sha256":"20e11ca340fc0d2e087773997bf99d7db5847be4340155a7ca05675451c26fd4"},{"path":"manifests/b/BleachBit/BleachBit/5.0.2.3065/BleachBit.BleachBit.locale.en-US.yaml","sha256":"063e9166e4bdcb027ea6aac52db5f20f6cee368236d9e83818fcd2fe81a7c318"},{"path"